    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Aquila Kill Team",
    "summary": "Whenever an attack is made against this unit while its models have differing T, work out the [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) that attack needs from the T most of its models have, until the attacking unit finishes attacking. If 2 or more T values tie for most models, use the highest of them.\n\nWhen working out which models of this unit can [embark](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in a **TRANSPORT**, each Gravis Veteran model counts as 2 models. Otherwise it can embark in any **TRANSPORT** its unit can, even if comparable models elsewhere are **GRAVIS** models.",
